   "skipped": false,
   "text": "GoGloby\nApplied AI Engineering Partner\nWe are a US-based talent acquisition agency specializing in assisting tech companies to discover, assess, and hire the world's most thoroughly vetted talent within the US & EU time zones.\nGoGloby\nGoGloby Headquarters\nSergey Matikaynen\nCo-founder & CTO of GoGloby. Leads the Agentic SDLC methodology, secure development environment design, and the technical architecture behind the Applied AI Engineering system.\nVit Koval\nVitaly Koval\nCo-founder of GoGloby. For the past decade, has helped engineering leaders scale teams across the US, Canada, Argentina, Brazil, Mexico, and Europe — generating $60M+ in value. Built the Applied AI Engineering system to give tech leaders board-ready proof of AI-driven engineering velocity.\nGoGloby Applied AI Engineering Service Catalog\nApplied AI Engineering\nGoGloby turns engineering into AI-native production. It puts Claude into production for established software, without risking the codebase. Forward-deployed AI Solutions Architects, safe by design.\nGenerative AI Development Services\nProduction-ready generative AI delivery covering GenAI integration, multi-agent orchestration, optimization and evaluation, and ongoing support and governance. GoGloby's Applied AI Software Engineers build copilots, AI agents, RAG applications, and agentic workflows using LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, and AutoGen. Forward-deployed into your team in under 4 weeks. Zero IP exposure. $3M combined liability (cyber, data and professional) from day one.\nAI Staff Augmentation\nEmbed the top 4 percent of Applied AI Software Engineers directly into your team, your sprints, your tools, and your codebase. Every engineer is vetted through a 4-stage technical funnel covering Specify, Navigate, Architect, and Govern. Vetted profiles delivered in 72 hours. First validated feature in 3 to 5 business days. 120-day telemetry-backed replacement guarantee. $3M combined liability (cyber, data and professional) included.\nHire Applied AI Engineers\nDirect hire recruitment for senior Applied AI Engineers brought directly into your headcount. Every candidate runs GoGloby's 4-stage vetting funnel (Specify, Navigate, Architect, Govern) with only 4 percent passing. Shortlist delivered in 5 days. 50 percent faster time-to-hire than US job boards. 120-day replacement guarantee. No fee until you hire. Talent network spans 5 plus US-timezone countries.\nGoGloby\nGoGloby is an Applied AI Engineering partner turning engineering into AI-native production: every AI dollar visible, every feature shipped faster.",
